{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":326969,\"title\":\"Una Familia Complicada\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"For the Navarro family, appearances are everything. But after the sudden death of Alberto, the family patriarch, their carefully constructed façade begins to crumble. Doña Telma takes control of the family fortune and reputation while struggling to contain the conflicts among her children, whose betrayals, ambitions, and reckless decisions bring them dangerously close to crime.​ Amid secrets, deception, marriages of convenience, and forbidden relationships, the Navarro family is drawn into a spiral of chaos. Yet Doña Telma’s greatest challenge will be the progression of Alzheimer’s disease, a silent threat that could erase not only her memories, but also the secrets holding her family together.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8IO6eC6w5OqIn6U6wuhB8fqJo4W.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3LRUUW9Gxw6MVvKgbtMYn2eoFLF.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":6,\"year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":20,\"createdBy\":[\"María Fernanda Suárez\"],\"networks\":[\"ViX\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"MX\",\"name\":\"MX\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-06-26\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":270,\"name\":\"Adriana Barraza\",\"character\":\"Telma Orozco de Navarro\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kfww4YbO9J2HpCldEqyyhQugwy5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1250865,\"name\":\"Marisol del Olmo\",\"character\":\"Lucrecia Navarro\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lRPfD9xg0UU2eFmwBD1kCB5xvQG.jpg\"},{\"id\":1310913,\"name\":\"Marcus Ornellas\",\"character\":\"Arsenio Navarro\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iYZnPftAhl5GfZ5FcKgDTPK8bYc.jpg\"},{\"id\":2833335,\"name\":\"Oka Giner\",\"character\":\"Layla Navarro\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A02d1PS1xyVitHkU0SaaaWsc9H1.jpg\"},{\"i